@startuml F3.6-D01-listar-estagios
title F3.6-D01 — Listar estágios para revisão
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "InternshipController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: /estagios?to=me
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /estagios?to=me
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT por orientador\nou vínculo COE
note right of Ctrl
  documentoPendente =
  AGUARDANDO_PARECER
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: page
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 lista
WebApp --> Prof: fila de estágios

@enduml
